{"3769870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RUNE GUNNER", "steam_appid": 3769870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUNE GUNNER is a 1-4 player co-op roguelite shooter where you fuse guns and magic, mix classes mid-run, and break your build in the best way possible.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP CHAOS, BUILT RUN BY RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in fast, chaotic runs where <strong>every choice reshapes your build</strong>. Stack abilities, adapt on the fly, and turn one good run into something unrecognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/0218bba6bd1a1064f2b87ced6b15540b.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/0218bba6bd1a1064f2b87ced6b15540b.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/0218bba6bd1a1064f2b87ced6b15540b.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIX CLASSES MID-RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with one class and <strong>add more mid-run</strong>. New abilities and passive runes stack together to reshape how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/1143623d5c7277355b9aa6de4c6a91fb.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/1143623d5c7277355b9aa6de4c6a91fb.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/1143623d5c7277355b9aa6de4c6a91fb.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO FLAT STATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes change how you play, not just the numbers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never reload</strong> and let every shot hit harder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn shields into ammo</strong> and fire endlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burn one enemy</strong> and detonate the whole room</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/2232f48c540f0900193878ce10bb23ab.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/2232f48c540f0900193878ce10bb23ab.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/2232f48c540f0900193878ce10bb23ab.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERPOWERED RUNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong runs build momentum quickly. <strong>Stack synergies</strong>, take risks, and push your loadout further with every room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/7d74818dcbf26abdb61b848f0dfb74e8.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/7d74818dcbf26abdb61b848f0dfb74e8.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/7d74818dcbf26abdb61b848f0dfb74e8.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVE INTO THE SHROUD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shroud is a fractured realm overrun by hostile Constructs. To survive, you must wield the same unstable magic that powers them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/02dc493ec42cac828c97fcff90c3b80e.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/02dc493ec42cac828c97fcff90c3b80e.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/02dc493ec42cac828c97fcff90c3b80e.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHORT RUNS, BUILT FOR CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, replayable runs make <strong>experimentation easy</strong>. Procedural rooms and shifting class offerings keep each descent unpredictable. Drop in with friends, coordinate builds, and see how every run evolves differently.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUNE GUNNER is a 1-4 player co-op roguelite shooter where you fuse guns and magic, mix classes mid-run, and break your build in the best way possible.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP CHAOS, BUILT RUN BY RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in fast, chaotic runs where <strong>every choice reshapes your build</strong>. Stack abilities, adapt on the fly, and turn one good run into something unrecognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 